    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 87A St. Anne’s Square is a superb newly built, A0-rated three-bedroom end-of-terrace home, ideally positioned in the heart of Portmarnock. Built to a high standard and finished with quality and modern living in mind, this impressive home offers the significant advantages of a brand-new property, including excellent energy efficiency, contemporary finishes and exceptional comfort throughout.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hallway leading into a spacious lounge. Double doors seamlessly connect the lounge with the impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area, creating a wonderful space for both everyday family living and entertaining. Further double doors open directly onto the private landscaped rear garden. Upstairs, the property comprises three bedrooms and a modern family bathroom. \r\n\r\nPerfectly located in the heart of Portmarnock, the property is within easy reach of a host of local amenities, excellent schools, shops, cafés and restaurants, while Portmarnock DART Station and the beautiful Velvet Strand are also close by. The area offers an enviable coastal lifestyle while remaining within easy commuting distance of Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t 5.0 x 1.97\tTiled floor, spotlights, understair storage\r\n\r\nWc\t1.67 x 0.83\tTiled floor, whb with tile backsplash, wc\r\n\r\nLounge\t3.98 x 3.54\tTiled floor, light fitting, overlooking green space, double doors to kitchen / dining room\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining room\t5.59 x 4.32\tTiled floor, oven, hob, extractor fan, fitted kitchen units, dishwasher, 2 x velux windows, double doors to rear garden, spotlights, light fitting, fitted units\r\n\r\nStairs / landing\t\tCarpet floor, access to attic\r\n\t\t\r\nFamily Bathroom\t1.72 x 2.30\tTiled floor & walls, heated rail, wc, whb, walk in shower with handheld shower head & feature overhanging shower head\r\n\r\nBedroom 1  3.22 x 2.90\t Decorative timber floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t3.07 x 3.7\tDecorative timber floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t2.18 x 2.46\tDecorative timber floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nRear Garden    Landscaped, part patio, part lawn, fully fenced"
      },
